{"id":"166289335b97f6e6","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-minimalwinning.md","title":"Minimal winning coalitions and positive prime implicants","display":"thm-minimalwinning — Minimal winning coalitions and positive prime implicants","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-minimalwinning","aliases":["27-thm-minimalwinning"],"display":"thm-minimalwinning — Minimal winning coalitions and positive prime implicants","depends_on":["[[27-df-simplegame]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§1.13.3","source_printed_pages":"55,56","source_pdf_pages":"79,80","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-minimalwinning"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-minimalwinning</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-minimalwinning — Minimal winning coalitions and positive prime implicants"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"84fb6d5dede03600\" href=\"?note=84fb6d5dede03600\" title=\"27-df-simplegame\">27-df-simplegame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.13.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"55,56"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"79,80"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=[n]\">\\(N=[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)\">\\(\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_v\">\\(f_v\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"84fb6d5dede03600\" href=\"?note=84fb6d5dede03600\" title=\"27-df-simplegame\">27-df-simplegame</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> 为素蕴涵项集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq N\">\\(A\\subseteq N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_A\">\\(C_A\\)</span> 是下节构造的正项函数，空积等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_A\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in A}a_i\\right)\\mid a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\right\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_A\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in A}a_i\\right)\\mid a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\right\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f_v)=\\left\\{C_A\\mid A\\subseteq N\\land v(A)=1\\land\\forall B\\subsetneq A\\;v(B)=0\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PI}(f_v)=\\left\\{C_A\\mid A\\subseteq N\\land v(A)=1\\land\\forall B\\subsetneq A\\;v(B)=0\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若联盟 A 最小获胜，单调性保证 C_A 所覆盖的所有联盟获胜，删任一文字都会覆盖一个败选子联盟，所以它是素项。反之，正函数的素项没有负文字；其正文字集合必须是最小获胜联盟。常零博弈给出空素项族，常一博弈给出空联盟及常一空项，均与公式相容。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-simplegame","status":"resolved","id":"84fb6d5dede03600","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-simplegame]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-simplegame","status":"resolved","id":"84fb6d5dede03600","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$N=[n]$，$v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 且 $\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)$，$f_v$ 见 [[27-df-simplegame]]。$\\mathrm{PI}$ 为素蕴涵项集，见 [[27-df-piset]]。对 $A\\subseteq N$，$C_A$ 是下节构造的正项函数，空积等于 $1$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$N=[n]$，$v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 且 $\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)$，$f_v$ 见 [[27-df-simplegame]]。$\\mathrm{PI}$ 为素蕴涵项集，见 [[27-df-piset]]。对 $A\\subseteq N$，$C_A$ 是下节构造的正项函数，空积等于 $1$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"N=[n]","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\mathcal P(N)\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MonotoneGame}(v)","display":false},{"tex":"f_v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"C_A","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"C_A\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(a,\\prod_{i\\in A}a_i\\right)\\mid a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\right\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f_v)=\\left\\{C_A\\mid A\\subseteq N\\land v(A)=1\\land\\forall B\\subsetneq A\\;v(B)=0\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-minimalwinning|thm-minimalwinning — Minimal winning coalitions and positive prime implicants]]"}],"outgoing":["84fb6d5dede03600","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}